{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "728e8dc76c2ba51b65ee27f77a25778ded080d9486f8bbf7bba6f3ca6d292361", "ja": "（アイドル達が出演した番組『アイドルプリズン』の\n映像確認の連絡がきてたな。あとで見ないと……）", "zh": "（偶像们出演的节目《偶像监狱》发来了确认影像的通知啊。得找时间看看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "48fd9e9460794dbb713cbfb96ce0233b2639b0051c5d74527ee2738e812409a6", "ja": "ムッフッフッ……{$P$}さーん！\n『アイドルプリズン』の映像が届いたって聞きました！", "zh": "嘻嘻嘻……{$P$}先生！听说《偶像监狱》的影像送到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "18f8cfa25c16bc9e78b0b7a7b27b2244198d462db6c0e0b1a9da06aee53610b4", "ja": "当然チェックしますよね？　ありさもお手伝いします！\n……アイドルちゃんのとれたて映像……ムフフ♪", "zh": "当然要检查一下对吧？亚利沙也来帮忙！\n……刚出炉的偶像妹子影像……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bf6abf58b494e050814eb01bbf1f08e6b4a063b5e64c665d82a63fc75bde0c0b", "ja": "耳が早いな、亜利沙……。\nまあ、一緒に見るくらいなら構わないけど。", "zh": "消息真灵通啊，亚利沙……\n不过，只是一起看看倒也没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "46725530efbdb12b11bd4be1996766b10e9b7c68f31eadc3968c919bf637b79d", "ja": "でも届いたのはまだ一部みたいだ。\n亜利沙が捕まってから脱獄するシーンまでらしい。", "zh": "不过好像还只送到了一部分。\n听说只有从亚利沙被抓到越狱的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "422c21ac0cb98a19413f0b412e3abc28ecc0b479d8e8eaa100c6214bbe3b472c", "ja": "えっ。ありさがメインなんですか……？\nそれは……ちょっと残念ではありますが……。", "zh": "诶。是以亚利沙为主角的吗……？\n那还真是……虽然有点遗憾……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "91b8ffd3457ba16dcb811e0e0f2910d3932c0212e04bdce8338ae3678e028e29", "ja": "でもでも、他のアイドルちゃん達もいろんな場所に\n映り込んでますよね！　一秒だって見逃しませんよ～！", "zh": "不过，不过，其他偶像们也在各种地方入镜了吧！哪怕一秒都不会错过哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "478799c3ab5ecf531a0c83186d9a4e78c4b72509d535b580572c87ff803911f2", "ja": "そ、そうか。じゃあ一緒にチェックしよう。", "zh": "是、是吗。那就一起确认吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "63f9c5f4f4979a4475bb91fe2ff9be59f6e86795360f2f18a4ade3ae442995ae", "ja": "しかし……亜利沙が捕まるシーンは、\n妙にリアリティがあって、なんだか緊張するな……。", "zh": "不过……亚利沙被抓住的场景，莫名地很有真实感，让人不由得紧张起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "97914df6024438bcee437db072f6d110615f937cc1e39344ed5af28d6e641f5b", "ja": "そそ、それはどういう意味ですか！？\nありさはまだ真っ白……いえ、綺麗な灰色ですよ！", "zh": "那、那是什么意思啊！？\n人家还是一片纯白……不对，是漂亮的灰色哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "4263fdedd568071b6e07f63dd8af2d515e381807e20f910a3547562218d7ce4d", "ja": "安心してください。最近はちゃんと許可をとってます！\n……アイドルちゃんに気づかれた時だけですけど。", "zh": "请放心。最近我都有好好取得许可的！\n……虽然只限于被偶像们发现的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6b4a43c2c8d2a751225426778287ce52e6786b3cbd563f7cd6781724ff7e00c7", "ja": "そ、そうか……程々にな。でも実際にアイドル罪で\n捕まったら、亜利沙は推し活ができなくて大変だな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……还是适可而止吧。不过要是真的因为偶像罪被抓起来，亚利沙没法追星可就难受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "5da3b78d34999e21d453a5c2f92f171ac7ff9ecbe0c3bd735ff821524bf3a324", "ja": "いいえ、{$P$}さん！　ありさの\nアイドルちゃんへの情熱はそんなことでは消えません！", "zh": "不，{$P$}先生！　亚利沙对\n偶像小天使们的热情才不会因为这种事就熄灭呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "7bf838e1a6a8f28ab261311c47c63876a60f658a32f71ae136090f13b357f2c3", "ja": "仮に絶海の孤島に収監されたとしても、必ず脱出して\nアイドルちゃんのライブを見に行きます！", "zh": "就算被关进远离人烟的孤岛上，我也一定会逃出去，去看偶像们的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "4df5b732474cd212a53e20f8351f800ded28ab9588068523e4fa1a2be7f0cb95", "ja": "たとえ！　どんなことになろうとも！　ありさの\nアイドルちゃんへの愛は消えたりしませんよぉー！", "zh": "就算！不管变成什么样！亚利沙对偶像们的爱也绝不会消失哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c58f1a903f4eff509f4a768d61364bfb56e26eef0a15aaab6c5bc3495be888de", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。その情熱があるなら、番組での\n亜利沙の活躍も期待できるな！　よし、続きを見るか！", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错。有这份热情的话，就能期待亚利沙在节目中的精彩表现了！好，继续看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "d2e95e60865fd5b8372df9d2d2740f1ce3a7038a5974f1e326b97fe32a16cf71", "ja": "ええ～っ！　それとこれとはちょっと話が違うかと……\nあ、でも……とれたて映像は早く見たいかも……？", "zh": "诶诶～！这和那个不太是一回事吧……\n啊，不过……刚拍好的影像，我好像也想早点看看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0313_1018_p", "source_sha256": "261f1a4377de73a528059ef7ac605d9455249d3f6b3a9da45adc92b21adcde47", "ja": "（少し心配になる時もあるが、亜利沙のアイドルへの\n情熱は本物だ……俺がしっかり見守っていこう）", "zh": "（虽然有时也会让人有些担心，但亚利沙对偶像的热情是真心实意的……我会好好守望着她）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
